{
    "title": "Indie Madness Music World",
    "description": "Indie Music World welcomes you, our Friday music friends!\r\nIt's night time! Enjoy digital rhythm! Stand a chance to rap battle against all indie enemies from funny circus (Finn, Impostor V5, Silly Billy, Twiddle finger).\r\nIn this madness mod, BF roles as a funny plumber and use his rap talent with the help of Girlfriend. Boyfriend must battle several creepypasta based on Marios Madness V2.\r\nUgh? Don't forget your mission! Find missing Princess! Save GF in danger!\r\n\r\nTIPS TO BE A WINNER\r\nThis game does not require you have to jump and run like marios. Just follow digital rhythm! Dance with cg5 music! \r\nTap the arrow to make them match right on the beat!\r\n\r\nGAME FEATURE\r\n- Simple gameplay, offline mode\r\n- Digital rhythm follow your fingers\r\n- Awesome graphics with great sound effects\r\n- Full high-qualited backgrounds from all indie mods\r\n\r\nHave fun!\r\nFollow our vibrant game community to update new mods frequently!",
